apple-suite-mcp
===============

This project is a fork and substantial rewrite of:

    supermemoryai/apple-mcp
    https://github.com/supermemoryai/apple-mcp
    Copyright (c) 2025 Dhravya Shah and contributors
    Licensed under the MIT License.

Significant changes from upstream:
  - Security rewrite: structured native backend replaces AppleScript string
    interpolation (eliminates the injection class).
  - Capability model: modules disabled by default, opt-in per module, read/write
    separation, isolated TCC-responsible helper for Full Disk Access.
  - MCP 2025-11-25 compliance: Streamable HTTP + OAuth 2.1, Resources/Tools/Prompts
    split, elicitation-based confirmation, structured output.
  - Supply-chain hardening: pinned dependencies, provenance, SBOM.

The MIT license text and copyright notice above are retained per the terms of
the upstream license.
